{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your fortune from scratch.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with small jobs to earn your first money, then step into the world of investing. Work as a cashier, trash collector, or cargo driver to save up, then dive into stocks and crypto. Markets change dynamically with in-game events and media news, so every headline can impact your wealth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you get richer, you can buy houses and cars, and explore a vibrant city full of side activities. From humble beginnings to becoming a successful investor, every decision you make shapes your lifestyle in this life simulation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stocks &amp; Crypto</strong><br>Grow your fortune with smart investments!<br>Pick the right stocks in a dynamic market and catch opportunities.<br>Want more risk? In the crypto market, you can play big with leverage \u2014 multiplying your fortune in a single move, or risking it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Casino</strong><br>If you trust your luck, you\u2019re in the right place!<br>Roulette, blackjack, coin flip and more will bring you adrenaline-filled moments.<br>Double your savings or lose it all \u2013 it\u2019s all up to you and your luck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Office</strong><br>Strengthen your place in the business world by purchasing your own office.<br>Your office boosts both your prestige and the value of your fortune.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Home</strong><br>Decorate your own house in a city that lives with a day\u2013night cycle.<br>Lie down, sleep, and wake up to a new day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And with many more features\u2026<br>In Stock Market Simulator, rise with your own decisions, grow your fortune, and reach the top of the <strong>Rich Times ranking</strong>!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4048560?t=1767975349","background_raw":"https://s